{"boundary":"This is static tracked source text. Use it for source grounding only; do not infer private runtime state from it.","chunkCount":2,"chunkHash":"dcc9a79e196ed0f6678554d94169371ebd19c988130b0af70ce238becbf6343e","chunkIndex":0,"chunkText":"import Foundation
